t\/uploads\/2026\/05\/VSH_BRSE_1-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/VSH_BRSE_1-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/VSH_BRSE_1-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-35699df e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"35699df\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3c45753 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3c45753\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 28-02-2024 *\/\n.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-stacked .elementor-drop-cap{background-color:#69727d;color:#fff}.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-framed .elementor-drop-cap{color:#69727d;border:3px solid;background-color:transparent}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap{margin-top:8px}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap-letter{width:1em;height:1em}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap{float:left;text-align:center;line-height:1;font-size:50px}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap-letter{display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t<p>A new milestone in Vulcan Shield Global&#8217;s long-term commitment to the region where its newest manufacturing facility is taking shape.<\/p><p>Vulcan Shield Global is pleased to share that its Hungarian subsidiary, Vulcan Shield Hungary, has signed on as an official sponsor of B\u00e9k\u00e9scsabai R\u00f6plabda SE (BRSE), one of the most decorated volleyball clubs in Hungary, beginning with the 2026\/2027 season. BRSE is a five-time Hungarian National Champion and three-time Hungarian Cup winner, with a youth programme that supports approximately 300 young athletes. In the most recent season, the club captured national gold in the U20, U17 and U15 age categories \u2014 a first in the history of Hungarian volleyball.<\/p><p>The sponsorship follows the laying of the foundation stone of Vulcan Shield Hungary&#8217;s new manufacturing facility in B\u00e9k\u00e9scsaba in April 2026. From the outset, the Group&#8217;s intention has been clear: to build more than a factory, and to become a long-term partner to the community in which it operates. BRSE&#8217;s emphasis on long-term development, the nurturing of young talent, and the pursuit of excellence closely mirrors the values that guide Vulcan Shield Global. Supporting an organisation that is shaping the next generation of athletes in B\u00e9k\u00e9scsaba, the very city where the Group is investing in the future of its industry, is a natural extension of that commitment.<\/p><p>We look forward to the season ahead and to a partnership that will benefit the club, its young athletes, and the wider B\u00e9k\u00e9scsaba community.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6ad4e76 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"6ad4e76\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8a24aa5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"8a24aa5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;full&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8cfcdf2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"8cfcdf2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_